The benchmark serves Qwen3-Reranker models (Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B, -4B and -8B) by Alibaba Cloud's Qwen team,
published at https://huggingface.co/Qwen under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No model files are in this
repository. scripts/qwen3_reranker.jinja is the models' prompt format, as given on their model cards.

The request sets are built at run time from datasets downloaded from Hugging Face (BEIR's SciFact, FiQA and
ArguAna; LongEmbed; MS MARCO for the int8 calibration). None of their text is in this repository; each dataset
has its own terms.

TL Engine, the inference engine measured here, is not part of this repository.
